# POLLY, every key sounds: the 200 KB GM set's last waves have no data (wt_200k_samples.c stops 127 samples short), so
# the top regions of a dozen programs were silent (the Clavinet from note 69, the organs from 90, harmonica, brass,
# synth brass, saw lead, polysynth, sweep pad from 79-90 on), and notes below a program's lowest region sounded nothing;
# eas_voicemgt.c VMStartNote takes the nearest region with data. MIDI in on channel 4, each note alone, its peak.
wait 300
midi C3 07 00
wait 600
peakreset
midi 93 18 64
wait 400
expect peak_db_min -40
